{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/react/16_lifecycle과_useeffect/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"component의-인생\" style=\"position:relative;\">Component의 인생<a href=\"#component%EC%9D%98-%EC%9D%B8%EC%83%9D\" aria-label=\"component의 인생 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>Component는 Lifecycle이라는 개념이 있다.<br>\n이 Lifecycle에 맞춰 코드를 실행할 수 있다.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>생성 mount</li>\n<li>재 렌더링 update</li>\n<li>삭제 unmount</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 659px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/f5b2afa099e23f33c9a9bb941fd34ef2/4978c/image1.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 41.66666666666667%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/f5b2afa099e23f33c9a9bb941fd34ef2/a59e9/image1.webp 192w,\n/static/f5b2afa099e23f33c9a9bb941fd34ef2/0ca9f/image1.webp 384w,\n/static/f5b2afa099e23f33c9a9bb941fd34ef2/f67d4/image1.webp 659w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 659px) 100vw, 659px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/f5b2afa099e23f33c9a9bb941fd34ef2/3b721/image1.png 192w,\n/static/f5b2afa099e23f33c9a9bb941fd34ef2/66595/image1.png 384w,\n/static/f5b2afa099e23f33c9a9bb941fd34ef2/4978c/image1.png 659w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 659px) 100vw, 659px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/f5b2afa099e23f33c9a9bb941fd34ef2/4978c/image1.png\"\n            alt=\"alt text\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span>\r\n<em>출처 : 코딩애플</em></p>\n<h2 id=\"component-인생에-간섭하는-법\" style=\"position:relative;\">Component 인생에 간섭하는 법<a href=\"#component-%EC%9D%B8%EC%83%9D%EC%97%90-%EA%B0%84%EC%84%AD%ED%95%98%EB%8A%94-%EB%B2%95\" aria-label=\"component 인생에 간섭하는 법 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Detail 컴포넌트 등장 전에 이것좀 해줘</li>\n<li>Detail 컴포넌트 사라지기 전에 이것좀 해줘</li>\n<li>Detail 컴포넌트 업데이트 되고 나서 이것좀 해줘</li>\n</ul>\n<p>이렇게 컴포넌트 라이프 사이클에 맞춰 코드를 실행해달라고 간섭할 수 있는데, 간섭은 갈고리를 달아서 한다.<br>\n갈고리는 영어로 hook, 그래서 이것을 Lifecycle hook 이라고 부른다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/debbcd96680c98a3a123fe879ec444cd/4219d/image2.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 40.10416666666667%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/debbcd96680c98a3a123fe879ec444cd/a59e9/image2.webp 192w,\n/static/debbcd96680c98a3a123fe879ec444cd/0ca9f/image2.webp 384w,\n/static/debbcd96680c98a3a123fe879ec444cd/dc9b9/image2.webp 768w,\n/static/debbcd96680c98a3a123fe879ec444cd/addc7/image2.webp 866w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/debbcd96680c98a3a123fe879ec444cd/3b721/image2.png 192w,\n/static/debbcd96680c98a3a123fe879ec444cd/66595/image2.png 384w,\n/static/debbcd96680c98a3a123fe879ec444cd/fe486/image2.png 768w,\n/static/debbcd96680c98a3a123fe879ec444cd/4219d/image2.png 866w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/debbcd96680c98a3a123fe879ec444cd/fe486/image2.png\"\n            alt=\"alt text\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span>\r\n<em>출처 : 코딩애플</em></p>\n<h2 id=\"lifecycle-hook-사용법-useeffect\" style=\"position:relative;\">Lifecycle hook 사용법, useEffect()<a href=\"#lifecycle-hook-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%EB%B2%95-useeffect\" aria-label=\"lifecycle hook 사용법 useeffect permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>상단에서 useEffect를 import 한다<br>\n콜백함수를 추가해서, 그 안에 코드를 적으면 그 코드는<br>\n컴포넌트가 mount, update 시 실행된다.<br>\n이것이 Lifecycle hook 이다!</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>useState<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> useEffect<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">Detail</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">useEffect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">=></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token comment\">//여기적은 코드는 컴포넌트 로드 &amp; 업데이트 마다 실행됨</span>\r\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'안녕'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>생략<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<blockquote class=\"prompt-tip\">\n<p><strong>왜 ‘안녕’은 2번 출력 됨?</strong><br>\nindex.js에 &#x3C;React.StrictMode>라는 태그가 있으면 2번 출력해줍니다.<br>\n디버깅용이다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"useeffect-밖에-적어도-똑같은데요\" style=\"position:relative;\">useEffect 밖에 적어도 똑같은데요?<a href=\"#useeffect-%EB%B0%96%EC%97%90-%EC%A0%81%EC%96%B4%EB%8F%84-%EB%98%91%EA%B0%99%EC%9D%80%EB%8D%B0%EC%9A%94\" aria-label=\"useeffect 밖에 적어도 똑같은데요 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>비슷한것 같지만 useEffect 안에 적은 코드는 html 렌더링 이후에 동작한다.</p>\n<p>예를 들어서 시간이 많이 걸리는 코드가 필요한 경우 useEffect 안에 써주면, html을 먼저 보여주고 나서 반복문을 돌리게 된다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">Detail</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">useEffect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">=></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>반복문 <span class=\"token number\">10</span>억번 돌리는 코드<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>생략<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"useeffect-에-넣을-수-있는-실행조건-둘째-파라미터\" style=\"position:relative;\">useEffect() 에 넣을 수 있는 실행조건, 둘째 파라미터<a href=\"#useeffect-%EC%97%90-%EB%84%A3%EC%9D%84-%EC%88%98-%EC%9E%88%EB%8A%94-%EC%8B%A4%ED%96%89%EC%A1%B0%EA%B1%B4-%EB%91%98%EC%A7%B8-%ED%8C%8C%EB%9D%BC%EB%AF%B8%ED%84%B0\" aria-label=\"useeffect 에 넣을 수 있는 실행조건 둘째 파라미터 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>useEffect()의 둘째 파라미터로 [ ] 를 넣을 수 있는데, 이곳에는 변수나 state를 넣을 수 있다.<br>\n그렇게 하면 [ ] 안의 변수나 state가 변할때만 useEffect 안의 코드를 실행해준다.<br>\n그래서 아래의 코드는 count 라는 변수가 변할때만 실행된다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token function\">useEffect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">=></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> 실행할코드 <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>count<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>[ ]안에 아무것도 넣지 않으면 mount 시(로드 시) 1회 실행하고 영영 실행해주지 않는다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token function\">useEffect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">=></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> 실행할코드 <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"clean-up-function\" style=\"position:relative;\">clean up function<a href=\"#clean-up-function\" aria-label=\"clean up function permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>useEffect() 동작하기 전에 특정 코드를 실행하고 싶으면<br>\nreturn ()=>{} 안에 넣을 수 있다. 이것을 clean up function 이라고 한다.</p>\n<p><strong>실행순서 : return 먼저,  그다음 useEffect</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token function\">useEffect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">=></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> \r\n  그 다음 실행됨\r\n\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">=></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    여기있는게 먼저실행됨\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>count<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>타이머같은 경우, mount 될때마다 타이머를 제거해주는 것이 좋다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token function\">useEffect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">=></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> \r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> a <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">setTimeout</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">=></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token function\">setAlert</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">2000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">=></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token function\">clearTimeout</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>a<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<blockquote class=\"prompt-tip\">\n<p>(참고1) clean up function에는 타이머제거, socket 연결요청제거, ajax요청 중단 이런 코드를 많이 작성한다.<br>\n(참고2) 컴포넌트 unmount 시에도 clean up function 안에 있던게 1회 실행된다.</p>\n</blockquote>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#component%EC%9D%98-%EC%9D%B8%EC%83%9D\">Component의 인생</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#component-%EC%9D%B8%EC%83%9D%EC%97%90-%EA%B0%84%EC%84%AD%ED%95%98%EB%8A%94-%EB%B2%95\">Component 인생에 간섭하는 법</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#lifecycle-hook-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%EB%B2%95-useeffect\">Lifecycle hook 사용법, useEffect()</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#useeffect-%EB%B0%96%EC%97%90-%EC%A0%81%EC%96%B4%EB%8F%84-%EB%98%91%EA%B0%99%EC%9D%80%EB%8D%B0%EC%9A%94\">useEffect 밖에 적어도 똑같은데요?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#useeffect-%EC%97%90-%EB%84%A3%EC%9D%84-%EC%88%98-%EC%9E%88%EB%8A%94-%EC%8B%A4%ED%96%89%EC%A1%B0%EA%B1%B4-%EB%91%98%EC%A7%B8-%ED%8C%8C%EB%9D%BC%EB%AF%B8%ED%84%B0\">useEffect() 에 넣을 수 있는 실행조건, 둘째 파라미터</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#clean-up-function\">clean up function</a></li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Sep 30, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"16. Lifecycle과 useEffect","summary":"Component의 인생 Component는 Lifecycle이라는 개념이 있다. 이 Lifecycle에 맞춰 코드를 실행할 수 있다. 1. 생성 mount 2. 재 렌더링 update 3. 삭제 unmount","date":"Nov 11, 2022","categories":["REACT"],"tags":[],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/react/16_lifecycle과_useeffect/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/react/15_react_router_dom_url_parameter/","title":"15. react-router-dom URL parameter"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/react/17_react_axios/","title":"17. React Axios"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}